---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fang & Forge Productions"
  description="Fang & Forge Productions is an independent creative studio building original worlds, stories, tabletop experiences, and digital tools."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Independent creative studio</div>
      <h1>We build worlds worth getting lost in.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Fang & Forge Productions is building original settings, stories, tabletop experiences,
        and digital tools. Veyra is our first world, with more worlds and projects to come.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/worlds/veyra">Explore Veyra</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/about">Who we are</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">What we're creating</div>
      <h2>One studio. Many worlds.</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Veyra</h3>
          <p>
            Our first developing world: a setting for lore, stories, campaigns, maps, characters,
            and future releases.
          </p>
          <a href="/worlds/veyra">Enter Veyra →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Tabletop & VTT Projects</h3>
          <p>
            We are experimenting with tools and systems designed to make tabletop worlds easier
            to run, explore, and share.
          </p>
          <a href="/projects">See our projects →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Future Worlds</h3>
          <p>
            Veyra is the beginning. Fang & Forge is designed to become a home for additional
            original settings and creative projects.
          </p>
          <a href="/worlds">View worlds →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Follow the build</div>
      <h2>We're building this in public, piece by piece.</h2>
      <p>
        The studio, website, worlds, and tools are all actively being developed. Over time this
        site will grow into the central home for Fang & Forge releases, world lore, development
        updates, downloads, and supporter content.
      </p>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/support">Future supporter access</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
